  "releaseNotes": "TinyEvents.SqlServer.EntityFrameworkCore 0.1.0-alpha.1\n\n      Added\n      - SQL Server EF Core outbox writer using caller-owned DbContext changes.\n      - SQL Server worker store with atomic lease-based claiming.\n      - EF Core model builder extension for the outbox schema.\n\n      Notes\n      - Early alpha / active development.\n      - APIs may change before 1.0.\n      - Consumers must be idempotent because delivery is at-least-once.",
